# Enforce LF in every checkout, on every platform.
# CI runs a windows-latest leg and this plugin ships plain JS/YAML/JSON/SVG that
# must stay byte-identical across checkouts; with autocrlf the Windows leg could
# otherwise get a CRLF working tree, spurious diffs and CRLF-sensitive failures.
# The rule below already covers every text file, so no per-extension list is needed.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never diff, merge or line-ending-normalize them.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.tgz  binary
*.zip  binary
